{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18297","headline":"赠崔立之 · 韩愈","name":"赠崔立之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年十日雨，子桑苦寒饥。\n哀歌坐空室，不怨但自悲。\n其友名子舆，忽然忧且思。\n搴裳触泥水，裹饭往食之。\n入门相对语，天命良不疑。\n好事漆园吏，书之存雄词。\n千年事已远，二子情可推。\n我读此篇日，正当寒雪时。\n吾身固已困，吾友复何爲。\n薄粥不足裹，深泥谅难驰。\n曾无子舆事，空赋子桑诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}